<title>SINGAPORE: Acma sells 2 mln Lityan shares.</title>
<headline>Acma sells 2 mln Lityan shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acma Ltd said on Friday it has sold two million shares in its Malaysian unit Lityan Holdings Bhd at 21.00 ringgit per share though a placement.</p>
</text>
